IMPORT prelude
-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §2.3 (cross-party references) and §8.1 (nesting).
--
-- An EVERY inside the continuation of an EVERY: each partner MAY terminate,
-- and on each termination (ONCE EACH HAS) every OTHER partner must settle with
-- the one who left, all of them (ONCE ALL HAVE) before the fork's own
-- continuation counts as done. The outer variable `x` is referenced inside the
-- inner filter, action and continuation.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Partner HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Terminate HAS who IS AN Actor
    Settle    HAS who IS AN Actor, with IS AN Actor

chair MEANS Partner OF "Chair"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`mutual termination` MEANS
    EVERY Partner x
        MAY    Terminate (EXACTLY x)
        WITHIN 365
        ONCE   EACH HAS
        HENCE  EVERY Partner y
                   WHO    NOT (y EQUALS x)
                   MUST   Settle (EXACTLY y) (EXACTLY x)
                   WITHIN 30
                   ONCE   ALL HAVE
                   HENCE  FULFILLED
                   LEST   BREACH BY y

-- an EVERY inside the continuation of a plain PARTY obligation
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`after the chair gives notice` MEANS
    PARTY chair
        MUST   Terminate (EXACTLY chair)
        WITHIN 10
        HENCE  EVERY Partner p
                   WHO    NOT (p EQUALS chair)
                   MUST   Settle (EXACTLY p) (EXACTLY chair)
                   WITHIN 30
